## Documentation Methodology

Each lab follows a consistent documentation structure:

1. Objective
2. Environment
3. Tools and Commands
4. Step-by-Step Procedure
5. Expected Results
6. Actual Results
7. Troubleshooting
8. What I Learned
9. Evidence and Screenshots

## Learning Approach

All exercises are performed using available tools and safe environments.

Because SteamOS is an immutable operating system, I prioritize built-in commands, user-space applications, and isolated environments without disabling system protections or modifying protected system files.

## Current Progress

This repository is continuously updated as I complete new exercises and improve my technical knowledge.

